ional evaluation: the Barthel Index</article-title><source>Md State Med J</source><year>1965</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>61</fpage><lpage>65</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14258950</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morris</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name><name><surname>Murphy</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Nonemaker</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><source>Long-term resident care assessment user's manual</source><year>1995</year><publisher-name>Ver. 2.0. American Health Care Association. Washington, DC, USA</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shaughnessy</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Crisler</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Schlenker</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><source>Medicare's Oasis: standardized outcome and assessment information set for home care</source><year>1997</year><publisher-name>Oasis: B Centre for Health Services and Policy Research. Denver, Co, USA</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Harwood</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ebrahim</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><source>Manual of the London Handicap Scale</source><year>1995</year><publisher-name>Nottingham: University of Nottingham</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ware</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kosinki</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>The SF-36@Physical and Mental Health Summary Scales</source><year>2001</year><edition>2</edition><publisher-name>A